{"4018410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mechanis Obscura", "steam_appid": 4018410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanis Obscura is a first-person psychological escape-room thriller game, that fuses the intensity of real escape rooms with the atmosphere of early 2000s horror films. Featuring FMV cutscenes filmed in the heart of the city of  Thessaloniki, intricate puzzle mechanisms, and ARG elements that bleed beyond the screen, the game challenges players to survive a trial they never meant to join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.poster.avif?t=1784111564\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.webm?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.mp4?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It begins in August 2025. Late at night, while browsing forgotten online forums, you unknowingly enroll in something you should never have touched. Days later, you are abducted by a secret underground organization and forced into a mechanical labyrinth hidden beneath the city. Every door locked, every mechanism ticking, every scene whispering that you were chosen for reasons still obscured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.poster.avif?t=1784111564\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.webm?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.mp4?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story of choice. There are no branching paths or alternate fates. Mechanis Obscura is built on one relentless truth: escape or vanish.  Along the way, you’ll uncover fragments of the organization’s presence sometimes hidden deep underground, sometimes standing in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.poster.avif?t=1784111564\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.webm?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.mp4?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game in the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its blend of puzzles, live-action sequences, and a suffocating atmosphere, Mechanis Obscura blurs the line between game and reality. What begins as an abduction soon becomes a descent into something larger, where the most obscure machinery might be the human mind itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.poster.avif?t=1784111564\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.webm?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.mp4?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> – A thriller inspired by early 2000s underground horror and their unsettling mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape-Room Adventure</strong> – Navigate gears, locks, and lethal contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong> – Intricate mechanisms and escape-room-style riddles that twist perception as much as intellect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live-Action Storytelling</strong> – FMV and live-action sequences woven into gameplay for a chilling, cinematic feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Web &amp; Abduction Themes</strong> – Uncover how you were taken—and why.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARG Elements</strong> – Extend the experience beyond the game into hidden trails and real-world puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> – Every corridor hides secrets, every choice leaves a mark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooted in Reality</strong> – A narrative set in Thessaloniki, beginning August 2025.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanis Obscura is a first-person psychological escape-room thriller game, that fuses the intensity of real escape rooms with the atmosphere of early 2000s horror films. Featuring FMV cutscenes filmed in the heart of the city of  Thessaloniki, intricate puzzle mechanisms, and ARG elements that bleed beyond the screen, the game challenges players to survive a trial they never meant to join.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.poster.avif?t=1784111564\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.webm?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/83e420b5489164075922d9aba56d6e9a.mp4?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It begins in August 2025. Late at night, while browsing forgotten online forums, you unknowingly enroll in something you should never have touched. Days later, you are abducted by a secret underground organization and forced into a mechanical labyrinth hidden beneath the city. Every door locked, every mechanism ticking, every scene whispering that you were chosen for reasons still obscured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.poster.avif?t=1784111564\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.webm?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/10b566a12b9cd151d145dfac35415644.mp4?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story of choice. There are no branching paths or alternate fates. Mechanis Obscura is built on one relentless truth: escape or vanish.  Along the way, you’ll uncover fragments of the organization’s presence sometimes hidden deep underground, sometimes standing in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.poster.avif?t=1784111564\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.webm?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/920ccf98f05415ddd3f901bac08a32d6.mp4?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game in the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its blend of puzzles, live-action sequences, and a suffocating atmosphere, Mechanis Obscura blurs the line between game and reality. What begins as an abduction soon becomes a descent into something larger, where the most obscure machinery might be the human mind itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.poster.avif?t=1784111564\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.webm?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/extras/ac8433cd23bb46656b3af5d22fa85a7a.mp4?t=1784111564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> – A thriller inspired by early 2000s underground horror and their unsettling mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape-Room Adventure</strong> – Navigate gears, locks, and lethal contraptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong> – Intricate mechanisms and escape-room-style riddles that twist perception as much as intellect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live-Action Storytelling</strong> – FMV and live-action sequences woven into gameplay for a chilling, cinematic feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Web &amp; Abduction Themes</strong> – Uncover how you were taken—and why.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARG Elements</strong> – Extend the experience beyond the game into hidden trails and real-world puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong> – Every corridor hides secrets, every choice leaves a mark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooted in Reality</strong> – A narrative set in Thessaloniki, beginning August 2025.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>", "short_description": "MECHANIS OBSCURA is an indie psychological escape-room thriller game, blending FMV cutscenes, 2000s horror vibes, and intricate puzzle mechanisms. After unknowingly enrolling in a deep-web trial, you have been abducted into a nightmarish escape room. No choices, only one reality remains...ESCAPE!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/c8bad323d9a53a344e1ef229bd2a46bbcef314dc/header.jpg?t=1784111564", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/bf8670b83a628cf00989fa7dc396d5902b1eaca1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784111564", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018410/bf8670b83a628cf00989fa7dc396d5902b1eaca1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784111564", "website": "https://nobudgetstudios.github.io/MechanisObscura_Website/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon RX 470 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Ti / AMD RX 5600 XT (6 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended for best performance and faster loading</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2025 NoBudgetStudios. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nMechanis Obscura™ is a trademark of NoBudgetStudios